            "review_text": "Meander62625869632\n5 contributions\n0\nGreat lunch spots, affordable\nFeb 2026 • Friends\n\"I came by your local Recommendation. It’s quite easy to find. While it’s busy at noon, the staff is very attentive and generous.\n\nThe food was quick, hot. I love how they present their food in rustic stickers or pottery plates. Prices are reasonable, Travelers don’t get stuck. It’s definitely the perfect place to go for a change when you’re tired of seafood in Nha Trang.”\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten February 23, 2026\nVuongLand Travel\nCảm ơn quý khách đã lựa chọn nhà hàng chúng tôi\nWritten March 8, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
